PUT {{baseUrl}}/employees/6aa66be8df59d5cd2ec54da8

Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Kumar",
  "email": "rahul.updated@proliant.com",
  "role": "Senior Developer",
  "department": "SAP",
  "status": "Active"
}

###

### 2.4 Delete Employee - Admin

